# Installing ArkheOS

## Prebuilt ISO (recommended)

1. Download the latest ArkheOS ISO from [arkheos.xyz](https://arkheos.xyz).
2. Open [Rufus](https://rufus.ie/), select the ISO and your USB drive, and leave
   all the extra Rufus options **unticked** 
3. Once the flash finishes, boot from the USB. When you get to partition
   selection in the Windows installer, **wipe all existing partitions** on the
   target drive first, then install onto the resulting unallocated space.
4. After first boot, Apply Playbook
5. Enjoy.

## Applying the playbook yourself

1. Install [AME Wizard](https://ameliorated.info/) and get a clean Windows 11 ISO.
2. Load the ArkheOS playbook from this repo's [Releases](https://github.com/Fola2x/ArkheOS/releases).


## Requirements

- Windows 11, build 26200 (25H2) — other builds are not supported
- Internet connection during install
- A USB drive, 8GB or larger recommended
- Easy bcd if no usb
